MAIN
MOVE TEMP 0 HALLOCATE 0
MOVE TEMP 1 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 Fac_ComputeFac
MOVE TEMP 2 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 Fac_ComputeFac
HSTORE TEMP 2 0 TEMP 3
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 0
MOVE TEMP 6 CALL TEMP 5 ( TEMP 2 PLUS 10 0 ) 
PRINT TEMP 6
END
Fac_ComputeFac [2]
BEGIN
CJUMP LE TEMP 1 0 L0
MOVE TEMP 2 1
JUMP L1
L0
NOOP
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 3 0
MOVE TEMP 5 CALL TEMP 4 ( TEMP 0 MINUS TEMP 1 1 ) 
MOVE TEMP 2 TIMES TEMP 1 TEMP 5
L1
NOOP
RETURN TEMP 2
END
